error[keywords]: `abstract` is a keyword and may not be used as an identifier
   ┌ test.idl:2:8
   │
 2 │ module ABSTRACT {
   ·        ^^^^^^^^ this is an IDL keyword
 3 │     struct Point {
 4 │         long x;
   └──
 help: the keyword can be escaped by changing to `_ABSTRACT`
 note: keywords are matched case-insensitively against identifiers
